  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: <a href=\"/tag/brainlab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Brainlab</a> and <a href=\"/tag/amrita+hospital+faridabad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Amrita Hospital Faridabad</a> have signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) to set up North India’s first <a href=\"/tag/centre+of+excellence+for+brain+%26+spine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Centre of Excellence for Brain &amp; Spine</a>.“The facility will be used for complex operations on the brain and spine, as well as a platform for clinical training, technology demonstrations and the sharing of knowledge between surgeons and health care professionals,” the two organisations said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>With Loop-X®, our mobile imaging robot, we are bringing intraoperative 2D and 3D imaging together with robotic functionalThe centre will be based on Brianlab’s Loop-X, a robotic mobile imaging system providing 2D and 3D cone-beam computed tomography (CBCT) images inside the operating room.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The process called <a href=\"/tag/intraoperative+imaging\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">intraoperative imaging</a> allows the surgeon to visualise the anatomy, verify the placement of any implants and acquire new images as necessary.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“The technology can supply surgical teams with current anatomical information, without the interruption of traditional imaging outside the OR that disrupts the operative workflow, by combining intraoperative images with Brainlab’s navigation ecosystem,” the medtech company explained.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 22, 2026 at 02:16 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 22, 2026 at 02:16 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe